        {
          "text": "Aba ebali intungulushi sha ndupwa sha bashibo: Efa, Ishi, Elieli, Asirieli, Yeremia, Hodafia elyo na Yadieli. Bali abacenjela mukulwa, abalumbuka, kabili intungulushi sha ndupwa sha bashibo. ",
          "type": "text",
